      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOLME BOY (1) continued a strong run of recent form and deserved his success last time out, scoring by 6 metres over 2040m at this track. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. His last-start form is good enough to win a race of this calibre. DIEGO DELGADO (4) was out of the money two back at this track. Turned in a better run last time out when third over 1780m at this track, beaten 3.5 metres. This is a nice drop in grade so he is in the right race to find winning form. MY SCIMITAR (7) found form and finished second two runs ago then came back to earth when he broke and finished a distant last over 1660m at Albion Park. Beautifully placed and is able to make amends. SHEEZ GOT TORQUE (2) is worth some thought after her last-start fifth over 1780m at this track on October 29.",
